div
    strong
        |Please note!
    div
        |Promotional and open-date tickets are non-refundable.
    div
        |The ticket is personal and cannot be transferred to another person.
br
div
    strong
        |Refund for an unused ticket
    div
        |If the passenger cancels the trip, they are entitled to a refund of the ticket price minus the advance booking fee. The following fee applies to a refund:
    ul(style="margin-bottom: 0px;")
        li
            |more than 30 days before departure: 10% of the ticket price;
        li
            |more than 72 hours before departure: 25% of the ticket price;
        li
            |more than 24 hours but less than 72 hours before departure: 50% of the ticket price;
        li
            |less than 24 hours before departure: 100% of the ticket price.
br
div
    strong
        |General conditions
    div
        |1.&nbsp;Passengers must arrive for boarding no later than 30&nbsp;minutes before the bus departs. Passengers are responsible for arriving late.
    div
        |2.&nbsp;A passenger with an open-date return ticket may return on any trip with free seats.&nbsp;An open-date ticket is valid for 6 months from the date of the first trip.
    div
        |3.&nbsp;If a passenger breaches visa rules (expired visa, passport replaced by another document, other objections from border guards), the carrier may refuse to carry the passenger without refunding the unused ticket.
br
div
    strong
        |Baggage rules
    div
        |The ticket price includes 2 pieces of baggage up to 60 cm × 40 cm × 40 cm with a total weight of up to 50 kg, including hand luggage up to 5 kg.
    div
        |The ticket price for children under 12 includes 1 piece of baggage up to 25 kg.
    div
        |Extra baggage is carried if there is room in the luggage compartment, at CZK 50/kg or the equivalent in UAH at the exchange rate on the day of payment.
br
div
    strong
        |All passengers and their baggage are insured during the trip
    ul
        li
            |Fictional insurer "Demo Insurance" (educational demo project). Insurance contract No. DEMO-0000.
    div
        |Liability limit per injured person for harm to passengers' life and health: UAH 500,000 (five hundred thousand).
    div
        |Liability limit per injured person for damage to baggage: UAH 5,000 (five thousand).
